# Crop Recommendation and Soil Profile Analysis

## 1. Project Overview
This project aims to recommend suitable crops based on soil nutrients and environmental conditions using Machine Learning techniques.

## 2. Dataset
The project uses the Crop Recommendation Dataset containing 2,200 samples, 8 columns, and 22 different crop classes.

Features include:
- Nitrogen (N)
- Phosphorus (P)
- Potassium (K)
- Temperature
- Humidity
- pH
- Rainfall

Target variable: Crop Label.

## 3. Technologies Used
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Scikit-learn
- Google Colab

## 4. Machine Learning Methods
The project investigates classification and clustering techniques, including:
- Logistic Regression
- Decision Tree
- Random Forest
- K-Nearest Neighbors
- Support Vector Machine
- Gaussian Naive Bayes
- Gradient Boosting
- K-Means
- Gaussian Mixture Model

## 5. Project Structure
- data/: Dataset files
- notebooks/: Jupyter notebooks
- src/: Python source code

